BRAND BIBLE v2.0 | Brahhm Arpan Organic Pvt. Ltd.

**1. BRAND FOUNDATION**

**Brand Name ****&**** Meaning**

BioMart combines "Bio" (Greek for life) with "Mart" (marketplace). A living, breathing marketplace dedicated to products that sustain and nourish life in its most natural form.

**Mission Statement**

To bring back pure, honest, and chemical-free groceries to every Indian household — making clean eating accessible, affordable, and reliable without compromise.

**Core Values**

• Purity First — Every product free from chemicals, pesticides, and artificial additives

• Honest Sourcing — Locally and ethically sourced, direct from organic farmers

• Science-Backed Quality — 250+ global testing standards, fully lab-tested

• Accessibility — Premium organic groceries at fair, reachable prices

• Non-GMO Commitment — All products naturally grown, never genetically modified

• Pan-India Reach — Delivering freshness and purity to every corner of India

