• Health-First Family — 30–55 yrs, urban & tier-2 cities, manages family pantry

• Fitness Enthusiast — 22–40 yrs, gym-goers, macro-conscious

• Conscious Mother — 28–45 yrs, reads ingredient labels, feeds children

• Organic Convert — Urban professional switching from conventional grocery

• Senior Health-Seeker — 55+ yrs, managing lifestyle conditions via diet

• Ayurveda Follower — Values ancient grains, traditional spices, pure ghee

